WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:03,373
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,423 --> 00:00:05,611
This is Episode 51.

3
00:00:05,661 --> 00:00:08,274
Maya has a big pile of papers.

4
00:00:08,324 --> 00:00:10,002
Too many to sort.

5
00:00:10,052 --> 00:00:12,280
And a muddy blob is watching.

6
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:13,529
Oh no!

7
00:00:13,579 --> 00:00:15,662
Here comes the secret lamp.

8
00:00:15,712 --> 00:00:17,691
It floats over the pile.

9
00:00:17,741 --> 00:00:18,878
Blank.

10
00:00:18,928 --> 00:00:20,064
Blank.

11
00:00:20,114 --> 00:00:21,250
Blank.

12
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,998
Then, a heart.

13
00:00:23,048 --> 00:00:24,122
Pink!

14
00:00:24,172 --> 00:00:25,173
Beep!

15
00:00:25,223 --> 00:00:27,035
That one is private.

16
00:00:27,085 --> 00:00:28,627
It keeps going.

17
00:00:28,677 --> 00:00:30,187
Another heart.

18
00:00:30,237 --> 00:00:31,291
Pink!

19
00:00:31,341 --> 00:00:32,342
Beep!

20
00:00:32,392 --> 00:00:34,444
Two secrets in the pile.

21
00:00:34,494 --> 00:00:36,941
Maya puts them in the whisper jar.

22
00:00:36,991 --> 00:00:38,086
Safe.

23
00:00:38,136 --> 00:00:40,427
The blob flips through the pile.

24
00:00:40,477 --> 00:00:41,613
Blank.

25
00:00:41,663 --> 00:00:42,800
Blank.

26
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:44,028
Nothing.

27
00:00:44,078 --> 00:00:45,495
It groans.

28
00:00:45,545 --> 00:00:48,158
The lamp finds the private papers.

29
00:00:48,208 --> 00:00:50,302
Before anyone else does.

30
00:00:50,352 --> 00:00:52,362
That is the secret lamp.

31
00:00:52,412 --> 00:00:54,277
Now you know Macie!

32
00:00:54,327 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
